{"4182430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "DEATH PENALTY", "steam_appid": 4182430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH PENALTY</strong> <strong>is a perilous dungeon crawling game where the odds are stacked completely against a human like you. Your only hope at survival is to carefully traverse the demonic fortress by lurking in the shadows and scavenging for anything that might give you a fighting chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tread lightly. Lurk in the shadows. Getting discovered is a death sentence. They'll tear you to shreds if you leave them any opening.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll have to use clever tactics and stolen weapons to even have a chance of gaining the upper hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the sprawling, interconnected corridors. You'll need to go deeper if you want to see the light of day again. Unlock the dungeon from the inside out. There's got to be a way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're practically naked. Scavenge the bodies of those before you. Treat your wounds, arm yourself, and take back your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEATH PENALTY</strong> <strong>is a perilous dungeon crawling game where the odds are stacked completely against a human like you. Your only hope at survival is to carefully traverse the demonic fortress by lurking in the shadows and scavenging for anything that might give you a fighting chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a337cb940ba494db4cc35668a6f9616d.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tread lightly. Lurk in the shadows. Getting discovered is a death sentence. They'll tear you to shreds if you leave them any opening.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You'll have to use clever tactics and stolen weapons to even have a chance of gaining the upper hand.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/7a613b42f5d3d85ec3ff4a043be911f6.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Navigate the sprawling, interconnected corridors. You'll need to go deeper if you want to see the light of day again. Unlock the dungeon from the inside out. There's got to be a way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You're practically naked. Scavenge the bodies of those before you. Treat your wounds, arm yourself, and take back your life.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.poster.avif?t=1787824375\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.webm?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/extras/a45bfc3319b9ad883c362f78d6869b29.mp4?t=1787824375\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "YOU ARE SENTENCED TO DEATH... Slither your way through an impenetrable fortress crawling with devils faster, stronger, and more cunning than any human. By sheer luck you've slipped through the cracks, but discovery means certain death. How long are you going to delay the inevitable?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/b3fa6e7b845168e6a533715665016feb4164e159/header.jpg?t=1787824375", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/5ab5218f7348610273b1c9aa9bc59e30a4a4bd1e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787824375", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4182430/5ab5218f7348610273b1c9aa9bc59e30a4a4bd1e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787824375", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 x64<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500 / AMD Phenom II X4 965<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 750 / Radeon RX 560X<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 9999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999999 GB RAM</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["HACKJOB"], "publishers": ["UnderWare"], "demos": [{"appid": 4716080, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam 